<mjml lang="nb" dir="ltr">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Tilbakestill passord</mj-title>
    <mj-include path="./partials/attributes.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />
    <mj-section padding="30px 24px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding="0"><h1 style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,Times New Roman,serif;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;line-height:42px;letter-spacing:-1px;color:#26211e;">Tilbakestill passord</h1></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Vi har mottatt en forespørsel om å velge et nytt passord for kontoen din hos Samfunnet i Bergen.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="{{ setup_url }}">Velg nytt passord</mj-button>
        <mj-text>Hvis du ikke ba om dette, kan du se bort fra e-posten. Passordet ditt blir ikke endret.</mj-text>
        <mj-text>Hvis knappen ikke virker, åpne denne lenken direkte:</mj-text>
        <mj-text><a href="{{ setup_url }}" style="color:#b9252b;word-break:break-word;">{{ setup_url }}</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
